title: "AxisVela Open: A Public Map of Independent Projects for Governed Autonomy"
type: software
version: 0.2.0
date-released: "2026-10-23"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/axisvela/axisvela-open"
url: "https://axisvela.github.io/axisvela-open/"
abstract: >-
  A public map of independent projects for governed autonomy, covering agent
  frameworks, coordination protocols, runtime and cognition, work and
  capabilities, identity and knowledge, boundary and assurance, and human and
  physical operations. Includes English and Chinese documentation, a
  machine-readable project index, and an annotated research map.
